      <h2>Random Number Generator – Generate Random Numbers Instantly</h2>
      <p>
        The <strong>Random Number Generator</strong> is a fast, versatile, and cryptographically secure online randomization tool. It allows users to generate single or multiple random integers and decimals within any custom range, create unique numbers with <strong>no repeats</strong>, spin an interactive <strong>random number wheel</strong>, or randomly pick names and items from custom lists.
      </p>

      <h2>What Is a Random Number Generator?</h2>
      <p>
        A <strong>random number generator (RNG)</strong> is a computational algorithm designed to produce a sequence of numbers or items that lack any discernible pattern, ensuring that every permissible value has an equal mathematical probability of selection.
      </p>
      <p>
        Random number generation is used across everyday decision-making, statistical sampling, prize draws, lottery ticket selections, board games, classroom activities, and scientific simulations.
      </p>

      <h2>How to Use This Random Number Generator</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Choose Generator Mode:</strong> Select Single Number, Multiple Numbers, No Repeats, Random Wheel, or Custom List Picker.</li>
        <li><strong>Enter Range:</strong> Specify your desired minimum and maximum bounds (e.g. <code>1 to 100</code>).</li>
        <li><strong>Select Options:</strong> Choose whole numbers vs. decimal precision, and toggle whether duplicate numbers are allowed.</li>
        <li><strong>Click Generate:</strong> Press the blue <strong>"Generate Random Number →"</strong> button or hit <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 font-mono text-xs">Enter</kbd>.</li>
        <li><strong>Copy or Reroll:</strong> Use <strong>Generate Again</strong> to instantly redraw or <strong>Copy Result</strong> to save the values to your clipboard.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Random Number Generator Wheel</h2>
      <p>
        The <strong>Random Number Generator Wheel</strong> brings a visual, interactive spinner experience to prize raffles, classroom activities, and lucky draws. Users can spin a number range or paste custom names (e.g., student names or team rosters).
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>No-Repeat Elimination Mode:</strong> Enabling the <em>"Remove Selected Value After Spin"</em> option automatically eliminates each winning segment from the wheel after it is selected, ensuring that no person or number is picked twice.
      </p>

      <h2>Random Number Generator No Repeats</h2>
      <p>
        When drawing raffle winners, lotteries, or assigning unique random groups, numbers must be non-repeating. The <strong>No Repeats</strong> mode ensures every drawn number is completely unique by utilizing an unbiased Fisher-Yates shuffle algorithm.
        <br />
        <em>Note:</em> The requested quantity cannot exceed the total count of whole numbers within the chosen range (e.g., requesting 15 unique numbers between 1 and 10 is mathematically impossible).
      </p>

      <h2>How Are Random Numbers Generated?</h2>
      <p>
        This calculator utilizes modern browser cryptographic APIs (<code>crypto.getRandomValues()</code>) where supported. Unlike basic pseudorandom linear congruential generators, cryptographic entropy ensures uniform distribution without predictable bias or seed repetition.
      </p>

      <h2>Google Random Number Generator</h2>
